sw/source/core/inc/hstsortedpropertylookup.hxx, sw/source/core/unocore/hstsortedpropertylookup.cxx.
Test: CppunitTest_sw_core_unocore testHstSortedPropertyLookup (sorted, unknown, out-of-order and repeated names
give the entries of getByName).
